{"4854320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conquer for Glory", "steam_appid": 4854320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise an army. Hold the line. Take the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't control single soldiers. You choose who to summon and where, then watch your troops crash into the enemy and fight over the one frontline that decides the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command dragons, giants and dark magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight races and dozens of units, from plain spearmen up to dragons, mammoths and a literal Cthulhu, each with its own ability: cavalry charges, teleporting assassins, lightning, dark magic. Charge your ultimate with kills, then unleash it to flood every lane at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a battle and take that kingdom, then spend your gold between fights on new units and upgrades: sharper weapons, thicker armour, faster training. Your army carries over and snowballs across the whole map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I grew up on Ben Olding's Flash game Warlords, and that feeling never left me. I built my own version at university and finally polished it into this, for anyone who remembers it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise an army. Hold the line. Take the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't control single soldiers. You choose who to summon and where, then watch your troops crash into the enemy and fight over the one frontline that decides the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/788bb0b9fe52673c52a20260a145074c.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command dragons, giants and dark magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight races and dozens of units, from plain spearmen up to dragons, mammoths and a literal Cthulhu, each with its own ability: cavalry charges, teleporting assassins, lightning, dark magic. Charge your ultimate with kills, then unleash it to flood every lane at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/848c1f75ecd1192d93c67c5715b44901.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a battle and take that kingdom, then spend your gold between fights on new units and upgrades: sharper weapons, thicker armour, faster training. Your army carries over and snowballs across the whole map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.poster.avif?t=1785579376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.webm?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/extras/8062a14e6d144c3a0c94996c0a39986c.mp4?t=1785579376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I grew up on Ben Olding's Flash game Warlords, and that feeling never left me. I built my own version at university and finally polished it into this, for anyone who remembers it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A side-on strategy game about raising armies and conquering a dark fantasy world. Lead one of eight races, break the enemy line with troops, monsters and unique abilities, and take the map kingdom by kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/1450edcb949e77dc5d306428568d183173b94538/header.jpg?t=1785579376", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/a55de0108edf008559994ff6eee84906587908db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785579376", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4854320/a55de0108edf008559994ff6eee84906587908db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785579376", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4000 series / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better (DirectX 11 capable)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<b